    "title": "Choosing a town centres on it (P9), and seven small fixes from the site audit (P11)",
    "why": "P9 (decisions/0053): the place pop-up gave our own towns (Show Low, Lakeside…) as their town area, which has no Within, so Get Local's distance vanished; towns are now points (Within, 10 mi to start), each town area its own choice. Approved by Jason (2026-11-13, proposal P11). (1) Sign-up said 'two quick questions'; the page asks four: now 'a few'. (2) Opening the confirmation link signs you in (as Jason chose), so the questions end on the dashboard. (3) 'See it as visitors do' on a hidden listing said 'not found' to its own team: they now see it, with a 'Hidden from the public' line. (4) Pulse: a Decide (form) step's answer now shows after the case refreshes. (5) Pulse: a step another library refuses says why, not 'didn't reach the site'. (6) Reports: the decision's answer is the site's notice, and the tool stays in Pulse's panel. (7) A like needs the thing to exist (and be shown). Its FAQ entries follow in a small release once crawler-w1 is live (Jason, 2026-11-13: send now, FAQ after).",
